{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2020-10", "window": 1, "start_date": 1601510400, "end_date": 1602115199, "month_true_total": 124, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:47:51 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "77181830", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027243249", "personaname": "Nathan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Pa_NaMa/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1369, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 777, "last_played": 1724092531, "avatar": "e547e7f6ff086f91ea3d1146a74995c558c4ec3e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Excellent game, still need more content to increase replayability but is already worth it's price", "timestamp_created": 1602082349, "timestamp_updated": 1602082349, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77118141", "author": {"steamid": "76561197990814415", "personaname": "57E", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/57E/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 1492, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 61, "last_played": 1734281673, "avatar": "4e825f6134e1e7a292424e0de7ea5a8d91b40afc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Surprisingly agile twitch shooter combat with great gun variety.\nDoesn't seem too impossibly difficult for a perma death game and you got three difficulty options to choose from.\nPermanent base camp unlocks, like multiple guns to choose from at the start of each run, add to the gameplay variety without feeling like a mandatory grind you have to do just have chance to reach the later areas.\n\nEnemy designs are tad too repetitive gray spherical cyclops robots.\nAnd level generation has the same issue that every other procgen shooter has: Where the map themes are always in same order so before long you are going to be fed up with having to always start on that same dessert canyon no matter how differently it's laid out at each time.\nAlternative map themes for each area, like in Binding of Isaac Rebirth -could go for a long way to ease the repetition or even just different times of day or changes in weather, like in City of Brass. \n\nRegardless...\nIf you are looking for a procgen first person shooter this is definitely among the better ones, looking forward to see how this develops.", "timestamp_created": 1601975680, "timestamp_updated": 1602062427, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.59767603874206543", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77105117", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055457833", "personaname": "Eerie Fridge", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Eeerefrge/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 222, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 190, "last_played": 1606366488, "avatar": "fab32d5d7261d73e15dc105bc704823f92b15c38"}, "language": "english", "review": "An amazing game as it is currently.  Hopefuly it will get even better with time!", "timestamp_created": 1601947871, "timestamp_updated": 1601947871, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "77054384", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123732379", "personaname": "Enewhal